import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Disclaimer" alternate="/disclaimer">
 <div class="container-page page-enter" style="padding-top:64px; padding-bottom:48px;">
  <header style="margin-bottom:40px; padding-bottom:32px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); max-width:var(--readable);">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Legal</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px); letter-spacing:-0.025em; font-weight:400;">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--ink-3); margin-top:8px; font-size:13px; font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing:0.04em;">Last updated: 2026-10-29</p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose max-w-none">
    <p><em>This is a translation of the <a href="/disclaimer">Korean disclaimer</a>. Where the two differ, the Korean version prevails.</em></p>

    <h2>AI-generated content</h2>
    <p>All analysis, market briefings and chart commentary on this site are <strong>generated automatically by an AI system (a large language model)</strong>, and the English edition is a machine translation of the Korean original. AI can make factual errors, omit figures or confuse context, and many articles are published without prior human fact-checking.</p>

    <h2>Not investment advice</h2>
    <p>Everything on this site is written <strong>for information only</strong> and does not recommend buying or selling any security. This site is not an investment adviser, discretionary investment manager or quasi-investment adviser under the Korean Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act, and is not a registered or reported financial investment business.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy and timeliness</h2>
    <p>Analysis is based on public information (filings, exchange announcements, news and the like). Information may be inaccurate or out of date because of:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>factual misreadings, conversion errors or confused context by the AI system, including in translation</li>
      <li>delays, errors or omissions by data providers (APIs)</li>
      <li>market movement between publication and reading</li>
      <li>corrections to company announcements or restated financial statements</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This site does not guarantee the completeness, accuracy or currency of any information.</p>

    <h2>Responsibility for investment results</h2>
    <p>Any investment decision made on the basis of this site, and any resulting gain or loss, is <strong>entirely the investor's own responsibility</strong>. The operator accepts no liability for any direct or indirect loss.</p>

    <h2>Conflicts of interest</h2>
    <p>The site does not categorically affirm or deny the operator's holdings in, intent to trade, or possible transactions in the securities it covers. Where a material interest exists (a current holding, a short-term trading plan, an outside advisory relationship and so on), it is disclosed in the article body or footer. An article without such a disclosure means that, at the time of publication, the operator had no known material interest in the security.</p>

    <h2>Creative content (Stories / Toons)</h2>
    <p>Narrative content ("Stories", "Toons") is <strong>fiction</strong> built on factual material. It does not depict the actual actions, words or thoughts of real people or companies, is labelled separately from analysis, and must never be a basis for investment decisions.</p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>This site may link to external sites and is not responsible for their content or accuracy.</p>

    <h2>Seek professional advice</h2>
    <p>Before making a specific investment decision, consult a qualified financial professional.</p>

    <h2>Corrections and removal requests</h2>
    <p>If an article contains a factual error or may infringe personal rights, write to <a href="mailto:nicepark0606@gmail.com">nicepark0606@gmail.com</a>; it will be reviewed and corrected or removed within a reasonable time.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</Base>
